{"title":"2020 INMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_INMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/9/d99c7df79fdcf28896abb2668e7ca622e9355c40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geqslant 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> be an integer and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28cd7ab875435317d3e4ebcaf2fc4a4ad5f5b0f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;a_1 \\le a_2 \\le \\dots \\le a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/2952b0c9da3605dd1ca9fff66c77e8ee16b99d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+\\dots+a_n=2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/83709fd0ea93b243a920cce97b95a5593f4321b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1a_2\\dots a_{n-1}+a_1a_2\\dots a_{n-2}+\\dots+a_1a_2+a_1+2 \\leqslant a_1a_2\\dots a_n.\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution.281.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution(1)\">Solution(1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_INMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution(1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we want to show that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b8bfc1c41224a9b81b369ee9a6c96c8ad2cb69.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1 + 2 \\le a_1a_2\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef2b8ca24c4af8de392310487e935e54c6bf151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/e/59ea469d426c0ff8ebb3c8f8a04ffed616f5e511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; a_1 \\le a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />. This is equivalent to showing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/0473cbdfa66584ef5e567227ceda321cf272e60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1-1)(a_1-2) \\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />, which is true.\n</p><p>Suppose, now, that the given inequality is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6fbf6b1b2bc81af471428fe2dc93cf475d6cd05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=k$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/7/c17d88e2fdeef66df0e37def936f39b773567278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Now, consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f05f085f774fc8ab50676b778b86a1f1d1114fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> reals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc3829531e9cc4c88f62de04118f75a59e10420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; a_1 \\le a_2 \\le \\cdots \\le a_{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"16\" /> with sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17ec37f3e099f07c1aa1027754d942599b8bc2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64ecff86da08460266b02dc220c489e8b82237f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; a_1 \\le a_2 \\le \\cdots \\le a_{k-1} \\le a_k + a_{k+1}-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"325\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/62822be6399a96defebc88dff96d318e1a418ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_2 + \\cdots + a_{k-1}+(a_k+a_{k+1}-2) = 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />, so by induction hypothesis,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b59127e65d6dd99856bcca3c9ec8b2cc9c95057.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^{k-1} a_1a_2 \\cdots a_i + 2 \\le a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k-1} \\cdot (a_k + a_{k+1} -2)\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"50\" />\nThis means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d7283d417830ea0dead635b8dda875cae3be7bd3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^k a_1a_2 \\cdots a_i + 2 \\le a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k-1} \\cdot (2a_k + a_{k+1} - 2) = a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k-1} \\cdot (a_ka_{k+1}-(a_k-1)(a_{k+1}-2)) \\le a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k-1} \\cdot (a_ka_{k+1})\\]\" width=\"890\" height=\"50\" />\nor\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17aa5be2cfed156fdd5c519f7efa91047ef23201.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1a_2 \\cdots a_k + a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k-1} + \\cdots + a_1a_2 + a_1 + 2 \\leq a_1a_2 \\cdots a_{k+1}\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"16\" />\nas desired.  ~biomathematics\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution.282.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution(2)\">Solution(2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_INMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution(2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a0275ce11b01d62869ca70686a8eb3bd1fc0859c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{Notation}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"77\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>Define,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/024d70896c90cc06e6a0d2af1552e2f58b1b2852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1=a_1+a_1a_2+\\cdots +a_1\\cdots a_{n-1}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"292\" height=\"15\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b03702b4477a9c994942f4d2d0467dd2ae66a551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2=a_2+a_2a_3+\\cdots +a_2\\cdots a_{n-1}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"292\" height=\"15\" />,\n</p><p>In general ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e04ef6fbded22908ba120cf85836ac54eb699a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_i =a_i +\\cdots + a_i\\cdots a_{n-1}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"230\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54d6e00b0453717b2e4dad0ce9bcc4cc88a5ff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall i&lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/89550959b4d0669210829ff4c2a0deb37f1d1266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{Claim(1)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"76\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/e/01e4c8725dc5f013fe8c21416d53e3680eef0577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1 &lt;2^{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/6/7b6a7a4f8561b3e7a83899a1eb6d0b7057356356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{ Proof:}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p>Using Tchevbycev inequality we have ,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/338637e9ef75760edbcb2d56e032c0d31a90cb6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S_1}{n} \\le \\frac {(n-1)a_1+2}{n} \\frac{S_2}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"176\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b21ef76518d42d283561fda5be5dde967d1139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies S_1 \\le \\frac {(n-1)a_1+2}{n} S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"213\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33ed954f509a2055455aa4828b7fad815b4af353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\le \\frac {(n-1)a_1+2}{n} . \\frac{ (n-2)a_2+2}{n-1} S_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"258\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/814165f7e582fa3927aeaa713e84538fb8566c35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\le \\prod _{i=1}^{n+1} \\frac {(n-i)a_i +2}{(n+1-i)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\" />.[Applying Induction on successive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0ec34cd8860ceb97113f81ba768ba739ad5166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />].\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b463b7a3d8ab910426933c31b37d835ec8ba13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1} (a_i +\\frac{2-a_i}{n+1-i})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"169\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/081a6e26f4cd7339c1c8a9ab91d664552c5993bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt; \\prod_{i=1}^{n-1} (a_i +\\frac {2-a_i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"137\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f938161b6c5acc38d945c4046c8078e5f8df63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1} \\frac {a_i+2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"96\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845d11983eed975e599a2ab83a5ed873420a4877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\le ( \\frac{\\frac{a_1+\\cdots +a_{n-1}}{2}+(n-1)}{n-1})^{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"224\" height=\"45\" />.[using GM-AM]\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/90666fa0c745160a6f7959f37e0d0f24eb8e7e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;2^{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/85261cdcd9d818125e6902566283a83ba195dc7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+\\cdots +a_{n} =2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/568d1dc4133227a544fef8868042beaaf5754cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> , Hence ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/e/8ce630164029cfebfa19e532978c1fee4e712932.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+\\cdots +a_{n-1}\\le 2n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"193\" height=\"14\" /> .\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/0914ffdd87c392bb202af2fee0b04e28f6d3100f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{Claim(2)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"76\" height=\"28\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/467e69a850e93069aeece75356dbf0ebc04adf1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{n-1}&lt; a_1\\cdots a_n \\le 2^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fead881ca5083ee04f9c3aa9c976c87234e6b41a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Proof}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<pre>The RHS inequality is trivial by AM-GM inequality.\n</pre>\n<p>For LHS inequality I would like to use induction.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/2125cccffc3440471504c03600426bbc532630ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n=2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fab743639c8bcf3aad4f2ff64dec10cb9419bc99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" /> ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/2/df2f418a68445b76bf630c648ce993d5434ba041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;a_1\\le 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />  and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de21f5c55b92d53859ed21d198b80607699fff84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84efafb3da0f4eecddceae55e6e3c7773dba642c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies a_1a_2 &gt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"17\" />.\nSuppose , the statement is true for<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6fbf6b1b2bc81af471428fe2dc93cf475d6cd05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=k$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> such that , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/c/f8cbb1172f4b1aaa504fa5787e116a6154ada3d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+\\cdots +a_k =2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2f1ea45c83157dea8ad9fb305fee857732a2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\cdots a_K&gt;2^{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now , consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebd6acd599ac285b0b7289f730436c8698d87488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;b_1 \\le b_2 \\cdots \\le b_{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Suppose ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4de18b233ec29af2fbf179d926ef171e4693e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_j  =2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" /> is median of the sequence,\nand<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6325b77e840e51ffa5b2d52b6a56c58249656f0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i=b_i ,\\forall i&lt;j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/685272b2f6ee76b989730f3674b55ebb08220eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i=b_{i+1},\\forall k\\ge i&gt;j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/389be92184f7109673cfa425c267487f34bd0435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies b_1+...+b_{k+1}=2k+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d2088089fee08bf403e7ac311e5b5463d6b4e2e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1..b_{k+1}&gt;2^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Our induction step is complete.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This two claim leads<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83f3f40679ea626b5e05aa96119be2a1dae488d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1&lt;a_i \\cdots a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" /> and equality for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c1bc61ad9df8e64d545453df17a575fe7e59f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=a_2=\\cdots =a_n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" />. ~trishan\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017134541\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11891/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19967:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017134541 and revision id 136610. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}